# the FILTERS page (0.15.15, after MIDI IN in the settings walk): the synths' filter types, low (as before), high, band, notch, peak, for the pad's
# saw sounds, the bass and the acid; kept with the settings across power-off (EN_FXS_FT_PAD 74, _BASS 75, _ACID 76)
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 27
expect fxs74 0
expect fxs75 0
expect fxs76 0
spin K2 1
spin K3 2
spin K1 4
wait 300
expect fxs74 4
expect fxs75 1
expect fxs76 2
shot filters_page.png
tap FX
wait 2000
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect fxs74 4
expect fxs75 1
expect fxs76 2
